### 7d. Catalog Service Health
GET http://localhost:8008/health

### 7e. Catalog Products Through Gateway
GET http://localhost:8000/catalog/products?limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7f. Catalog Categories Through Gateway
GET http://localhost:8000/catalog/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7g. Create Catalog Product Through Gateway
POST http://localhost:8000/catalog/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "sku_ridge_lamp",
  "name": "Ridge Camp Lamp",
  "category": "camping",
  "description": "Rechargeable camp lamp for alpine nights.",
  "price": 59,
  "currency": "USD",
  "metadata": {
    "tags": ["lamp", "camping", "lighting"]
  },
  "isActive": true
}

### 7h. Semantic Catalog Search Through Gateway
GET http://localhost:8000/catalog/search/semantic?q=waterproof%20hiking%20jacket&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7i. Semantic Reindex Status Through Gateway
GET http://localhost:8000/catalog/search/reindex/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7j. Rebuild Semantic Index Through Gateway
POST http://localhost:8000/catalog/search/reindex?limit=250
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7k. Semantic Recommendations Through Gateway
GET http://localhost:8000/recommendations/semantic?q=waterproof%20hiking%20jacket&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Login Through Gateway
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@acme.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "tenantSlug": "acme"
}

### 9. Extract token and test protected route
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 10. Get Current User Through Gateway
GET http://localhost:8000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 11. Create Event Through Gateway
POST http://localhost:8000/events
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "test_user_123",
  "eventType": "page_view",
  "eventData": {
    "page": "/dashboard",
    "duration": 30
  }
}

### 12. List Events Through Gateway
GET http://localhost:8000/events
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 12b. Event Summary Through Gateway
GET http://localhost:8000/events/summary?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 13. Ingest Events Through Gateway With Tenant API Key
POST http://localhost:8000/ingest/events
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-api-key: acme_api_key_12345

{
  "source": "storefront-web",
  "events": [
    {
      "userId": "anon_001",
      "eventType": "product_view",
      "eventData": {
        "productId": "sku_123",
        "category": "jackets"
      }
    },
    {
      "userId": "anon_001",
      "eventType": "add_to_cart",
      "eventData": {
        "productId": "sku_123",
        "quantity": 1
      }
    }
  ]
}

### 13b. In outbox mode, call the ingestion endpoint first, then verify the processor moves records into events.

### 14. Get Popular Recommendations Through Gateway
GET http://localhost:8000/recommendations/popular?limit=5&days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 15. Get User Recommendations Through Gateway
GET http://localhost:8000/recommendations/for-user?limit=5&days=30&userId=anon_001
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 15b. Get Similar Products Through Gateway
GET http://localhost:8000/recommendations/similar/sku_hiking_shell?limit=5&days=60
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 16. Create Purchase Events For Fraud Detection
POST http://localhost:8000/events
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "anon_001",
  "eventType": "purchase",
  "eventData": {
    "productId": "sku_123",
    "amount": 799
  }
}

### 17. Analyze Fraud Signals Through Gateway
GET http://localhost:8000/fraud/analyze?userId=anon_001&windowMinutes=60&purchaseAmountThreshold=500&velocityThreshold=1&sharedIpThreshold=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 18. List Fraud Alerts Through Gateway
GET http://localhost:8000/fraud/alerts?hours=24&minRiskScore=20&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 19. RAG Chatbot – Product Q&A Through Gateway
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Do you have any waterproof jackets for hiking?",
  "history": []
}

### 19b. RAG Chatbot – Follow-up
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What is the price?",
  "history": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Do you have any waterproof jackets for hiking?" },
    { "role": "assistant", "content": "Yes, we have the Stormguard Hiking Shell at $199." }
  ]
}

