  "email": "analyst@acme.com",
  "password": "securepass123",
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Analyst",
  "role": "analyst"
}

### 40. Update User Role (admin only)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/users/USER_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
