POST http://localhost:8000/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "paste-refresh-token-here"
}

### 53. Popular Recommendations (cached via Redis, TTL=120s)
GET http://localhost:8000/recommendations/popular?limit=5&days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 54. Per-Tenant Rate Limit Override
# Set TENANT_RATE_LIMITS=acme_api_key_12345:500 in docker-compose to give acme 500 req/min
# Default is 120 req/min for all tenants

### 55. Istio mTLS Status (requires Istio installed)
# kubectl get peerauthentication -n analytics-platform
# kubectl get destinationrule -n analytics-platform
